{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-006", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "TCL Zhonghuan converts 20 GW of TOPCon cell capacity to back-contact", "content": "<p>TCL Zhonghuan approved a CNY 2.6 billion ($382 million) upgrade project to convert 20 GW of TOPCon cell and 25 GW of TOPCon module capacity into BC production lines, with ramp-up expected from Q3 2026 and full production by Q1 2027.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/tcl-zhonghuan-converts-20-gw-of-topcon-cell-capacity-to-back-contact/\">TCL Zhonghuan converts 20 GW of TOPCon cell capacity to back-contact</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/tcl-zhonghuan-converts-20-gw-of-topcon-cell-capacity-to-back-contact/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-007", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "EU publishes draft terms of 4th hydrogen auction", "content": "<p>The European Commission has published draft terms and conditions for the fourth European Hydrogen Bank auction, planned for end-2026 with a €500 million budget.<br />\nThe procurement exercise will maintain competitive bidding and fixed-premium support while introducing strengthened eligibility requirements, including electrolyzer supply-chain resilience, cybersecurity, ans state aid compliance. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/eu-publishes-draft-terms-of-4th-hy", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/eu-publishes-draft-terms-of-4th-hydrogen-auction/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-008", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "‘Never underestimate the impact you can have, whatever your role’", "content": "<p>This week, Women in Solar+ Europe gives voice to Lindsay Dixon, Corporate Partnerships Manager at the UK’s SolarAid. She highlights how solar energy is not only a powerful tool for decarbonisation but also a pathway to inclusion—improving health, education, safety, and livelihoods for underserved communities. Through strong partnerships, women’s empowerment, and locally driven solutions, solar can create lasting social and economic impact.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/never-underestimate-the-impact-you-can-have-whatever-your-role/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-009", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "SVOLT brings LFP battery expertise from EVs to C&I and utility-scale storage markets", "content": "<p>At The smarter E 2026, Xu Tian, General Manager of Overseas Energy Storage Sales for SVOLT, announced the company’s plans to launch a 6 MWh container solution later in 2026.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/svolt-brings-lfp-battery-expertise-from-evs-to-ci-and-utility-scale-storage-markets/\">SVOLT brings LFP battery expertise from EVs to C&amp;I and utility-scale storage markets</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.<", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/svolt-brings-lfp-battery-expertise-from-evs-to-ci-and-utility-scale-storage-markets/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-010", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["installation_demand", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Switzerland deploys 1.33 GW of solar in 2025", "content": "<p>Switzerland’s PV market added 1.33 GW of new capacity in 2025, bringing cumulative installations to 9.5 GW, while solar generation covered 13.71% of electricity demand.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/switzerland-deploys-1-33-gw-of-solar-in-2025/\">Switzerland deploys 1.33 GW of solar in 2025</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/switzerland-deploys-1-33-gw-of-solar-in-2025/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-011", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Ines, Mondragon launch new industrial tool for integrating photovoltaics into custom-made products", "content": "<p>Ines and Mondragon Assembly have developed a pre-lamination system that creates prefabricated photovoltaic cores for integration into customized products, including electric mobility components and building facades.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/ines-mondragon-launch-new-industrial-tool-for-integrating-photovoltaics-into-custom-made-products/\">Ines, Mondragon launch new industrial tool for integrating photovoltaics into custom-made products</a> appeared first", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/ines-mondragon-launch-new-industrial-tool-for-integrating-photovoltaics-into-custom-made-products/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-012", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Laser-patterned poly-Si finger contacts reduce parasitic absorption, improve efficiency in TOPCon solar cells", "content": "<p>Researchers in China developed a laser-assisted poly-Si finger contact fabrication method combining picosecond laser modification and potassium hydroxide wet etching to reduce parasitic absorption in industrial TOPCon solar cells. The optimized process achieved a certified efficiency of 26.08% by improving optical performance while maintaining effective passivation and carrier transport.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/laser-patterned-poly-si-finger-contacts-re", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/laser-patterned-poly-si-finger-contacts-reduce-parasitic-absorption-improve-efficiency-in-topcon-solar-cells/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-10-013", "date": "2026-07-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Zambia introduces new procurement approaches as solar interest booms", "content": "<p>The first in a series of articles on energy markets in Southern Africa takes a look at the factors that have turned Zambia into one of Africa’s most attractive markets for renewable energy investment.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/zambia-introduces-new-procurement-approaches-as-solar-interest-booms/\">Zambia introduces new procurement approaches as solar interest booms</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/10/zambia-introduces-new-procurement-approaches-as-solar-interest-booms/", "type": "rss"}]}
